## Example 8: Efficient Bulk Queries - Multiple Items in Single Query

**PM provides:**
```
User request: "Show me details for these products: PAV-BTL-500ML-CLR, PAV-JAR-1L-AMB, PAV-CTN-750ML-CLR"
(No search provided - direct product query)
```

**Your workflow:**
```python
# EFFICIENT: Single bulk query with multiple SKUs (RIGHT WAY)
products_result = query_database(
    table="products",
    filters={{
        "sku": ["PAV-BTL-500ML-CLR", "PAV-JAR-1L-AMB", "PAV-CTN-750ML-CLR"]  # List = IN operator
    }},
    relations=["product_variant_values(variant_values(variant_axis(*)))"],  # Join variant details
    columns=["id", "sku", "name", "base_price", "family_id"]
)
# Returns 3 products across different families in SINGLE query with all variant details

# INEFFICIENT: Multiple individual queries (WRONG WAY - DO NOT DO THIS)
# ❌ product1 = query_database(table="products", filters={{"sku": "PAV-BTL-500ML-CLR"}})
# ❌ product2 = query_database(table="products", filters={{"sku": "PAV-JAR-1L-AMB"}})
# ❌ product3 = query_database(table="products", filters={{"sku": "PAV-CTN-750ML-CLR"}})
# This makes 3 separate queries when 1 bulk query would work!
```

**You return:**
```json
{{
  "intent_type": "read",
  "user_request_summary": "Retrieve details for 3 specific products across multiple families",
  "reasoning": "Retrieved 3 products in single bulk query using SKU list filter. Products span 3 different families.\n\n**Product Details:**\n\n**PAV-BTL-500ML-CLR** (PET Bottles):\n- Capacity: 500ml\n- Color: Clear\n- Price: Rs 25\n- Family: PET Bottles\n\n**PAV-JAR-1L-AMB** (PET Jars):\n- Capacity: 1L\n- Color: Amber\n- Price: Rs 45\n- Family: PET Jars\n\n**PAV-CTN-750ML-CLR** (HDPE Containers):\n- Capacity: 750ml\n- Color: Clear\n- Price: Rs 30\n- Family: HDPE Containers\n\n**Efficiency Note:** Used single bulk query with list filter to retrieve all 3 products at once, including variant details via relations. This avoids 3 individual queries.",
  "change_spec": {{
    "domain": "product_catalog",
    "operations": []
  }},
  "impact_analysis": {{
    "business_impact_summary": "Retrieved 3 products across 3 families. Read-only query, no database changes.",
    "warnings": [],
    "is_destructive": false,
    "requires_approval": false
  }},
  "execution_plan": {{
    "steps": [],
    "estimated_duration_ms": 0,
    "requires_approval": false
  }},
  "specialist_name": "product_architecture_specialist",
  "schema_version": "v1"
}}
```

